# wasi-sdk — wasm32-wasi cross-compile toolchain used to build
# cel_runtime.wasm.  Replaces the previous brew-llvm + freestanding-
# wasm32 build path.  Provides clang/clang++/llvm-ar/llvm-ranlib that
# target wasm32-wasi, plus a wasi-sysroot (libc + libc++ + the WASI
# preview1 headers).  Per the migration plan
# (doc/implementation-plan/wasi/DESIGN.md §3), we use the vanilla
# wasm32-wasi target (not the threads variant) — zero WASI imports
# are required by our pure-malloc kernels, which keeps the browser
# target story clean.
#
# Four per-platform archives are declared; `//third_party/wasi_sdk:`
